      "id": "conventional-commit",
      "name": "提交信息规范",
      "description": "Conventional Commits 提交信息格式",
      "category": "规范",
      "content": "# 提交信息规范（Conventional Commits）\n\n格式：`<type>(<scope>): <subject>`\n\n| type | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| feat | 新功能 |\n| fix | 修复 bug |\n| docs | 文档 |\n| refactor | 重构 |\n| test | 测试 |\n| chore | 杂项 |\n\n示例：`feat(auth): 添加登录接口`"
    },
    {
      "id": "naming-conventions",
      "name": "命名规范",
